graph TD
    A[Input Token Sequence] --> B[Token Embeddings plus Positional Encoding]
    B --> C[Decoder-Only Stack - N layers, e.g. GPT-OSS-120B]

    subgraph DecoderOnlyLayer [Each Layer]
        C1[Masked Multi-Head Self-Attention - each token attends only to previous tokens] --> C2[Add and Norm]
        C2 --> C3[Feed-Forward Network]
        C3 --> C4[Add and Norm]
    end

    C --> C1
    C4 --> D[Linear Layer plus Softmax]
    D --> E[Predicted Next Token]
    E -.fed back as input for next generation step.-> A

    style C fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff
    style E fill:#5cb85c,color:#fff